---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Frameworks & Models — Sovrin Group" section="resources">
  <section class="hero-page dark-zone">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="kicker">Resources · Frameworks &amp; Models</p>
      <h1>Frameworks &amp; Models</h1>
      <p class="lede">
        Sovrin Group's frameworks and models illustrate how our systems hold
        their shape. These high-level structures express the relationships
        between identity, governance, continuity, and AI reasoning without
        exposing internal mechanics.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="card-grid">
        <div class="card">
          <h3>Conceptual Models</h3>
          <p>
            Abstract representations of Sovrin Group's core principles and the
            identity-anchored structures that guide system behavior.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <h3>Structural Frameworks</h3>
          <p>
            High-level diagrams that show how identity, governance, and
            continuity interact across Sovrin's unified architecture.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <h3>System Models</h3>
          <p>
            Macro-level views of how Sovrin systems maintain form, enforce
            alignment, and preserve truth over time.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="section-lede" style="margin-top: 2.4rem; margin-bottom: 0;">
        Each model is designed to clarify the shape of Sovrin Group's
        architecture while maintaining the integrity of the invariant beneath it.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
